      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَرَّفٌ</span></b>  [<i>Elevated,</i> or <i>exalted, in rank, condition,</i>
or <i>estimation;</i> or <i>ennobled</i>]; (K, TA;) an epithet
applied to a man; from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّرَفُ</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also A
garment, or piece of cloth, <i>dyed with the red clay</i>
or <i>earth</i> [&amp;c.] <i>called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَف</span>. (IAar, TA.)

